                        (status Pending). Old pending bookings need a separate business review in
                        <a asp-page="/Bookings/Fulfilment" asp-route-Status="Pending" asp-route-To="@o.Today.AddDays(-1).ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")">Booking fulfilment</a>
