                    <li><span>Dispatched <span class="scope period">PERIOD</span></span><span>@N(o.Potted.CompletedDispatchCountInRange, "dispatch", "dispatches") &middot; @Qty(o.Potted.CompletedDispatchQuantityInRange) plants</span></li>
                </ul>
